            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows Vista<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2.2GHz Dual Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 1 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8800 GTS (512MB) / ATI Radeon HD4800 (512MB)<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 20 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> * Game engine uses OpenGL3.3 It is important that you get the latest drivers for your video card to ensure compatibility with this product.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 2.3 GHz Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 560 / ATI Radeon HD 5850 (1GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 20 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> * Game engine uses OpenGL3.3 It is important that you get the latest drivers for your video card to ensure compatibility with this product.</li></ul>"
